<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Sept 16.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Sept 16.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>FIXTURES -</p>
<p>Sea Muse (built 1976) 36,122 dwt prompt del off Santa Marta/redel Japan $8,500 daily Armada.</p>
<p>Zirje (built 1990) 48,320 dwt prompt del USG/redel E.C. Mexico $8,000 daily Pacnav.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859-1640</p>
</text>
